WEBVTT

00:04:28.990 --> 00:04:30.586
(Naer)

00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:33.536
Ta ütles, et anna mulle ka. 
Ma ütlesin: "E-I, ei."

00:04:33.560 --> 00:04:34.656
(Naer)

00:04:34.730 --> 00:04:36.216
See oli superlahe!

00:04:36.240 --> 00:04:39.416
Esimest korda elus oskan ma lugeda!

00:04:39.440 --> 00:04:42.320
See oli erakordselt lahe tunne!

00:04:43.240 --> 00:04:48.060
22-aastasena, 
tundes end hästi ja enesekindlalt,

00:04:48.450 --> 00:04:50.950
meenus see, mida kambrikaaslane ütles.

00:04:51.760 --> 00:04:55.496
Otsisin välja ajalehe majanduskülje.

00:04:55.520 --> 00:04:57.796
Tahtsin need rikkad valged üles leida.

00:04:57.893 --> 00:04:59.080
(Naer)